BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (QUICK START) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 756.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (Compile:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (./compile.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (Watch a single directory \(starts the monolith\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (./build/timetravel start /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (Add MORE repositories hot to the same daemon:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (./build/timetravel add /path/to/another/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (./build/timetravel add /path/to/docs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (See the whole swarm from ANY directory:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (./build/timetravel status) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (Edit files normally. To undo:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (./build/timetravel undo /path/to/file.c --last --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (./build/timetravel undo /path/to/file.c --to "2026-09-13 00:07:08" --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (./build/timetravel undo /path/to/file.c --to "10 minutes ago" --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (./build/timetravel undo /path/to/project --tag before-refactor --force --repo ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (/path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (To compare versions:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (./build/timetravel diff /path/to/file.c --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (./build/timetravel diff /path/to/file.c --to prev --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (./build/timetravel diff /path/to/file.c --to 15 --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (# To see inter-revision deltas, use dump --with-diff instead.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (To view history and status:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (./build/timetravel log /path/to/file.c --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (./build/timetravel status --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (./build/timetravel tag release-v1.0 --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (To export all versions and diffs:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (./build/timetravel dump /path/to/file.c --repo /path/to/project \\) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (    --out /tmp/tt_dump --with-diff) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (Lifecycle and maintenance:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (./build/timetravel stop                    # stop the whole monolith) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (./build/timetravel stop --repo <dir>       # remove ONLY that repo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (./build/timetravel restart <dir>) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (./build/timetravel tags [--repo <dir>]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (./build/timetravel compact [--repo <dir>]  # manual \(no more 03:00 auto-run\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (Create an encrypted repository:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (    ./build/timetravel start /path/to/project --encrypt) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (This prompts for a passphrase twice and creates:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (    /path/to/project/.timetravel/crypto.meta) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (Verify repository integrity:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (    ./build/timetravel verify --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (Compact a repository and run dedup GC:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (    ./build/timetravel compact --repo /path/to/project) Tj ET
endstream
