BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (1. WHAT IS TIME-TRAVEL) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (Time-Travel is a real-time file versioning daemon that watches a directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (tree via inotify and records every change as compact xdelta3 deltas.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (Think of it as "Ctrl+Z for your entire project folder":) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (Core capture and restoration:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (- Every edit, creation, and deletion is captured automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (- Restore any file or entire directory to any previous point in time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (- Named checkpoints \(tags\) for semantic rollback points.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (- Diff between any two versions of a file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (- Full export of reconstructed versions and consecutive diffs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (- Atomic writes: restorations never leave corrupted files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (- No initial backup: only changes are recorded \(copy-on-first-change\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (- Per-file directory undo: each file reverts to its own previous version.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (Multi-repo monolith \(v1.3\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (- ONE daemon watches up to 16 repositories at once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (- Hot add/remove of repositories without restarting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- Global status across the whole swarm from any directory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- Per-repo isolation: corruption in one repo never affects the others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (Dedup and encryption \(v1.4\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (- Files >= 1 MiB are stored as 64 KiB BLAKE2b content-addressed blocks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (  shared across files and versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (- Optional per-repository XChaCha20-Poly1305 encryption \(AEAD\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (- PBKDF2-HMAC-BLAKE2b key derivation; the passphrase is never stored.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (- Store verification: detect corrupted or tampered .ttd files, invalid) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (  magic, missing blocks, and failed AEAD authentication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (- Atomic compaction with fail-closed orphan-block GC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (Reliability and hygiene:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (- Robust exclusions: .git, node_modules, __pycache__, target, .cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (- Enhanced status showing daemon state, CPU, RAM, records, and bytes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (- Self-cleaning test battery: 116 assertions across 43 sections.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (- Audited with ASan/UBSan, ThreadSanitizer and Valgrind \(0 leaks\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (The final CLI binary is static, approximately 250 KB \(includes statically) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (compiled xdelta3, BLAKE2b, and the XChaCha20-Poly1305 crypto core\), with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (zero external runtime dependencies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (2. ENGINE ARCHITECTURE) Tj ET
endstream
