BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (a deliberate design decision to avoid writing records for files that never) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (change.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (How it works:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (1. On daemon startup \(or when a repo is added\), all existing files are read) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (   into a per-repo in-memory cache \(TtStateCache\). Each entry is marked as) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (   baseline_pending=1 \(no history\) or anchored=0 \(has history from previous) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (   sessions\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (2. NO records are written on startup. Zero.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (3. When a file is modified for the first time:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (   - If baseline_pending: writes CREATE [original] \(backdated to daemon) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (     startup\) + MODIFY/CREATE for the new content.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (   - If anchored but content differs from store: writes CREATE \(reanchor\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (     for the new content.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (   - If anchored and content matches: writes MODIFY \(delta\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (4. Subsequent changes produce MODIFY \(delta\) or CREATE \(fallback\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (Why backdate CREATE [original] to daemon startup?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (So that undo --tag or undo --to with a timestamp between startup and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (first change can find the original content. Without this backdating, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (original would have a timestamp later than the tag, making it invisible) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (for temporal restoration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (Recovery after daemon restart:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- Files with history in store: cached with anchored=0. First change triggers) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (  reanchor \(CREATE with full content\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (- Files without history: cached with baseline_pending=1. First change writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (  CREATE [original] + new version.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (- The per-repo start timestamp is reset to current time on every adoption.) Tj ET
