BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (When a captured file is at least TT_DEDUP_MIN_SIZE \(1 MiB\), Time-Travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (splits its content into TT_DEDUP_BLOCK_SIZE blocks \(64 KiB\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (Each block is hashed with BLAKE2b-256 and stored in the dedup pool:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (    .timetravel/blocks/<first 2 hex chars>/<remaining hex chars>) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (The .ttd record for a deduplicated file stores only the ordered list of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (32-byte block hashes, not the file content itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (Properties:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (- Identical blocks are stored only once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (- Identical blocks can be shared across files and versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (- Restore reconstructs the file by reading blocks from the pool.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (- Orphan blocks can be removed by compact/GC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (- In encrypted repositories, blocks are encrypted individually.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (- dump correctly reconstructs and exports deduplicated files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (  \(TT_EV_CREATE_DEDUP events are supported\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (Dedup is especially effective for:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (- large files with partially repeated content;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (- VM images, disk images, archives;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (- large generated files with stable regions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (Dedup is less effective for:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (- fully random data;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (- already compressed data;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (- encrypted data with high entropy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (15. ENCRYPTION \(V1.4\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (Time-Travel v1.4 supports optional per-repository encryption using) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (XChaCha20-Poly1305 \(AEAD\).) Tj ET
