BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (16. FAQ - FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (16.1 CAN I USE TIME-TRAVEL ON WINDOWS OR MAC?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (NO. Time-Travel uses Linux kernel-specific interfaces:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- inotify for filesystem events) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- timerfd for periodic ticks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (- rename\(\) atomicity guarantees \(POSIX\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (- mkstemp for secure temporary files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (There is no portability layer. It is Linux-only by design.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (16.2 DOES IT WORK OVER NFS / SSHFS / NETWORK MOUNTS?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (Partially. inotify DOES NOT work over NFS or SSHFS. The daemon will start) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (but won't receive events. The periodic rescan \(every 10 s\) will still) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (capture changes, but with higher latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (For network directories, consider running the daemon on the server and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (accessing the store remotely, or use a tool designed for network backup) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (\(BareSnap, Restic, Borg\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (16.3 HOW MUCH DISK SPACE DOES THE STORE NEED?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (General rule: the store needs between 0.5x and 1x the size of the unique) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (data being tracked, depending on change frequency.) Tj ET
endstream
